k"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...これ以上ベビーになったらやばいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、演技派を目指しますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなことに挑戦したいです‼\nファッション雑誌にも出たいです:)\nつっぱしるっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はベビたんのあたまなでなでしたーい！\nと思ってたりwうずうずw\nメンバーにあたまなでられたりとかする？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なでなでですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとかななみとかさゆりんになでなでされる><\nというかあごこしょこしょされる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日中学卒業式でした**\n私も高校生になるなんて\n信じられません(・・;)\nベビ先輩からのアドバイスありますか??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとうのことば\n言えなくてごめんなさい><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は中学生の時よりちょっと落ち着いたかな⁇\nとふと思いました:)\n新しい環境は不安だったけど、\n慣れてくると楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高1はとにかく楽しんで‼＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕をベビたんの弟にしてくれませんか(>★"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わおっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ私がおねーちゃんだっっ‼\n頭なでなで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメ遅い人は嫌いですか(；´Д｀)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことないですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくださるだけでもうれしいから。\nでも、毎回コメントしてくださる方の名前がないと、\n「あれ？」て思っちゃう><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しいのにコメントありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺にあだ名つけてください\n俺だけから呼んで欲しい呼び方は？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎにぎの時に話しましょっ^^ひひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんの家の中の宝物はなんですか(゜ロ゜)?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからのお手紙やプレゼント。\n観葉植物。\n...いっぱい‼\nというか家にあるものは全部宝物です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べひたんって何かお気にの香水ってある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくにないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりつけない人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パパさんがお土産でくれた\nちっちゃいボトル3つの香水。\nまだ一回しかつけたことないけど、\n良い香りです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人になったらつけたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃんは\n北海道好きー？＞＜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なまらすきよーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神奈川県の海老名市ってわかりますか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0034.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の個握のときの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0035.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうちょ飛んできて\n頭にとまって\nリボンになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}